{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营篇：计费基建与生命周期管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/subscription-economy/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"billing-infrastructure","title":"计费基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/subscription-economy/operations/billing-infrastructure","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"subscription-lifecycle","title":"订阅生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/subscription-economy/operations/subscription-lifecycle","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"subscription-analytics","title":"订阅数据分析与经营决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/subscription-economy/operations/subscription-analytics","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运营篇-计费基建与生命周期管理\">运营篇：计费基建与生命周期管理</h1><p>订阅业务的运营层远比一次性交易复杂——计费周期、用量计量、续费提醒、降级/暂停/恢复、发票合规、收入确认（ASC 606）等构成一套精密的基础设施。本章从计费技术架构入手，覆盖 Stripe Billing、Chargebee 等现代计费平台的设计理念与工程实现；继而展开订阅全生命周期管理的流程设计；最后聚焦订阅数据分析与经营决策——如何将 cohort、RFM、预测模型转化为可执行的运营动作。</p>\n"}